  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 2 and takes about 25 minutes from start to a bubbling, golden top. The thing to watch is the bechamel: keep stirring as you add the milk or lumps form and no amount of whisking will fix them once they set."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use thick-cut white bread if you can. Thin slices buckle under the weight of the sauce and do not hold the sandwich structure when you pick it up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
